WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.234 --> 00:00:03.903
NARRATOR: At last,
in October 19, 2005,

00:00:03.970 --> 00:00:07.640
after three years of
excavating Tutankhamun's tomb,

00:00:07.707 --> 00:00:12.112
Howard Carter and his team
begin to open the king's coffin.

00:00:18.251 --> 00:00:21.388
Lifting its lid
exposes another shroud.

00:00:26.292 --> 00:00:29.028
When Carter carefully
peels that back,

00:00:29.095 --> 00:00:34.200
he discovers a second gild
coffin even more magnificent.

00:00:38.004 --> 00:00:46.713
It has to be hoisted out of the
first, revealing decorations

00:00:46.780 --> 00:00:51.284
of iridescent blue, green,
and red glass inlay.

00:00:57.457 --> 00:01:03.263
And inside that, a third coffin.

00:01:07.434 --> 00:01:10.770
But this one is covered with a
thick black perfumed resonance

00:01:10.837 --> 00:01:11.771
material.

00:01:18.178 --> 00:01:21.481
With hammering, chemical
solvents, and heat,

00:01:21.548 --> 00:01:23.917
Carter's team
gradually cleans it.

00:01:27.420 --> 00:01:29.923
What this reveals is incredible.

00:01:33.026 --> 00:01:36.262
While the two outer coffins
were crafted from wood

00:01:36.329 --> 00:01:41.367
and covered in gold, this
one is made of solid gold.

00:01:45.305 --> 00:01:52.479
Winged goddesses
protect the king

00:01:52.545 --> 00:01:56.382
who holds the crook and
flail, symbols of royal power.

00:02:08.261 --> 00:02:12.732
It takes eight men to lift
its lid to reveal the most

00:02:12.799 --> 00:02:16.469
incredible sight of all.

00:02:16.536 --> 00:02:20.707
Tutankhamun's mummy
is covered in jewels

00:02:20.773 --> 00:02:25.912
and crowned with an exquisite
mask of solid gold, glass,

00:02:25.979 --> 00:02:27.280
and precious stones.

00:02:30.583 --> 00:02:36.122
AIDAN DODSON: And colorization
really brings out something.

00:02:36.189 --> 00:02:40.159
There is this amazing
helmet mask of solid gold

00:02:40.226 --> 00:02:44.364
inlaid with glass.

00:02:44.430 --> 00:02:48.334
There's this great
scarab on its breast.

00:02:48.401 --> 00:02:50.336
There are gold hands.

00:02:50.403 --> 00:02:54.507
There are inlaid strips
with magical formulae

00:02:54.574 --> 00:02:56.209
all over the whole thing.

00:02:59.412 --> 00:03:04.117
No one had ever seen this
before, a pharaoh laid

00:03:04.183 --> 00:03:08.254
exactly as he had
been by the priests

00:03:08.321 --> 00:03:09.889
3 and 1/2 thousand years ago.

00:03:13.026 --> 00:03:16.396
NARRATOR: The image of the gold
mask shoots around the world.

00:03:16.462 --> 00:03:20.199
But nowhere is its impact
greater than in Egypt itself.

00:03:21.801 --> 00:03:23.670
HEBA ABD EL-GAWAD:
This was a very highly

00:03:23.736 --> 00:03:26.139
emotional moment in Egypt.

00:03:26.205 --> 00:03:28.575
The discovery was
used as a reassertion

00:03:28.641 --> 00:03:31.778
of the Egyptian identity
and a proof of us being

00:03:31.844 --> 00:03:34.080
the descendants of
the ancient Egyptians,

00:03:34.147 --> 00:03:35.481
which means that
we're not supposed

00:03:35.548 --> 00:03:37.884
to be ruled by any foreigners.

00:03:37.951 --> 00:03:40.553
This meant that Tutankhamun
had to stay in Egypt

00:03:40.620 --> 00:03:43.222
and it were for the Egyptians.

00:03:47.160 --> 00:03:50.930
NARRATOR: As Carter struggles to
remove the mask from the mummy,

00:03:50.997 --> 00:03:57.003
its beard becomes detached,
revealing boyish looks.

00:03:57.070 --> 00:04:01.307
And here we have an explanation
of why his tomb is so small.

00:04:04.444 --> 00:04:07.347
This is not the tomb
of an old ruler.

00:04:07.413 --> 00:04:11.618
The remains are
of a teenage boy.

00:04:11.684 --> 00:04:16.155
Later research suggests
he died age 19.

00:04:16.222 --> 00:04:19.425
There hadn't been time to
finish an official tomb.

00:04:19.492 --> 00:04:23.963
So the jumbled objects and
small tomb are explained.

00:04:24.030 --> 00:04:29.535
It was quickly assembled for the
untimely death of a young man.

